<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns first of four credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns first of four credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned the first of four credits whereby it sought to inject 6.217 billion pesos on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	 AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    1.739 bln  11 days    27.78 pct</p>
<p>    1.739 bln   9 days</p>
<p>    1.739 bln   3 days</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
